  "description": "Seonjoo was a guy–a GUY–chillin’ in South Korea until pizza-kun sent him to Shirley-Pleehen, a game-like world. Summoneds from all universes run amok, using their Systems to adventure in dungeons for cash. But Seonjoo was summoned by the dragon god himself… into a genderless angel?!@?! He’s a GUY, I swear!! Say hello to Shirley-Pleehen’s first-ever healer class—equipped with a fairy, blessed by a dragon, and comfortable with violence! This petty fighter isn’t your average angel. \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
